city from the imminent danger. There are many enemies variants that you'll the discover in your playthrough that will keep you engaged and increase the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259990/extras/ff91560306844be94676d2fb88adfcf3.poster.avif?t=1738568448\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259990/extras/ff91560306844be94676d2fb88adfcf3.webm?t=1738568448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3259990/extras/ff91560306844be94676d2fb88adfcf3.mp4?t=1738568448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
